## 🎯 Chapter 5: Practice Problems

### Problem 1: Even or Odd Checker

```haryanvi
ye number = 42
ye remainder = number % 2

jab (remainder == 0) {
  bol "Even number hai"
} nahi_toh {
  bol "Odd number hai"
}
```

---

### Problem 2: Factorial Calculator

```haryanvi
// 5! = 5 × 4 × 3 × 2 × 1 = 120

ye n = 5
ye factorial = 1
ye i = 1

jab_tak (i <= n) {
  factorial = factorial * i
  i = i + 1
}

bol "Factorial of 5 is:"
bol factorial
```

---

### Problem 3: Prime Number Checker

```haryanvi
ye num = 29
ye is_prime = 1  // Assume prime (sahi)
ye divisor = 2

jab_tak (divisor < num) {
  ye remainder = num % divisor
  
  jab (remainder == 0) {
    is_prime = 0  // Not prime (galat)
  }
  
  divisor = divisor + 1
}

jab (is_prime == 1) {
  bol "Prime number hai!"
} nahi_toh {
  bol "Prime nahi hai"
}
```

---

### Problem 4: Fibonacci Series

```haryanvi
// 0, 1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, 21...

ye n = 10
ye a = 0
ye b = 1
ye i = 0

bol "Fibonacci series:"

jab_tak (i < n) {
  bol a
  
  ye next = a + b
  a = b
  b = next
  
  i = i + 1
}
```

---

### Problem 5: Reverse Number

```haryanvi
ye num = 1234
ye reversed = 0

jab_tak (num > 0) {
  ye digit = num % 10
  reversed = reversed * 10 + digit
  num = num / 10
}

bol "Reversed number:"
bol reversed
```

---

### Problem 6: Sum of Digits

```haryanvi
ye num = 12345
ye sum = 0

jab_tak (num > 0) {
  ye digit = num % 10
  sum = sum + digit
  num = num / 10
}

bol "Sum of digits:"
bol sum  // 1+2+3+4+5 = 15
```

---

### Problem 7: Power Calculator

```haryanvi
// Calculate 2^5 (2 to the power 5)

ye base = 2
ye exponent = 5
ye result = 1
ye i = 0

jab_tak (i < exponent) {
  result = result * base
  i = i + 1
}

bol "2 to the power 5:"
bol result  // 32
```

---

### Problem 8: GCD (Greatest Common Divisor)

```haryanvi
ye a = 48
ye b = 18

jab_tak (b != 0) {
  ye temp = b
  b = a % b
  a = temp
}

bol "GCD is:"
bol a  // 6
```

---

### Problem 9: Armstrong Number

```haryanvi
// 153 is Armstrong: 1^3 + 5^3 + 3^3 = 1 + 125 + 27 = 153

ye num = 153
ye original = num
ye sum = 0

jab_tak (num > 0) {
  ye digit = num % 10
  ye cube = digit * digit * digit
  sum = sum + cube
  num = num / 10
}

jab (sum == original) {
  bol "Armstrong number hai!"
} nahi_toh {
  bol "Armstrong nahi hai"
}
```

---

### Problem 10: Leap Year Checker

```haryanvi
ye year = 2024
ye is_leap = 0

ye check1 = year % 4
ye check2 = year % 100
ye check3 = year % 400

jab (check1 == 0) {
  jab (check2 == 0) {
    jab (check3 == 0) {
      is_leap = 1
    }
  } nahi_toh {
    is_leap = 1
  }
}

jab (is_leap == 1) {
  bol "Leap year hai!"
} nahi_toh {
  bol "Leap year nahi hai"
}
```

