## 🏆 Chapter 6: Mini Projects

### Project 1: Simple Calculator

```haryanvi
ye num1 = 45
ye num2 = 15
ye operation = 1  // 1=add, 2=subtract, 3=multiply, 4=divide

jab (operation == 1) {
  ye result = num1 + num2
  bol "Addition:"
  bol result
} nahi_toh {
  jab (operation == 2) {
    ye result = num1 - num2
    bol "Subtraction:"
    bol result
  } nahi_toh {
    jab (operation == 3) {
      ye result = num1 * num2
      bol "Multiplication:"
      bol result
    } nahi_toh {
      jab (operation == 4) {
        ye result = num1 / num2
        bol "Division:"
        bol result
      }
    }
  }
}
```

---

### Project 2: Grade System

```haryanvi
ye student_name = "Rahul Kumar"
ye marks_math = 85
ye marks_science = 92
ye marks_english = 78
ye marks_social = 88
ye marks_hindi = 80

ye total = marks_math + marks_science + marks_english + marks_social + marks_hindi
ye percentage = total / 5

bol "Student Name:"
bol student_name

bol "Total Marks:"
bol total

bol "Percentage:"
bol percentage

jab (percentage >= 90) {
  bol "Grade: A+ (Outstanding!)"
} nahi_toh {
  jab (percentage >= 80) {
    bol "Grade: A (Excellent!)"
  } nahi_toh {
    jab (percentage >= 70) {
      bol "Grade: B (Very Good)"
    } nahi_toh {
      jab (percentage >= 60) {
        bol "Grade: C (Good)"
      } nahi_toh {
        jab (percentage >= 40) {
          bol "Grade: D (Pass)"
        } nahi_toh {
          bol "Grade: F (Fail)"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

---

### Project 3: Electricity Bill Calculator

```haryanvi
ye units = 450
ye bill = 0
ye surcharge = 0

jab (units <= 100) {
  bill = units * 5
} nahi_toh {
  jab (units <= 300) {
    bill = 100 * 5 + (units - 100) * 7
  } nahi_toh {
    bill = 100 * 5 + 200 * 7 + (units - 300) * 10
  }
}

// Add surcharge if bill > 1000
jab (bill > 1000) {
  surcharge = bill * 10 / 100
  bill = bill + surcharge
}

bol "Units consumed:"
bol units

bol "Surcharge:"
bol surcharge

bol "Total Bill:"
bol bill
```

---

### Project 4: Number Guessing Game (Simple Version)

```haryanvi
ye secret_number = 42
ye guess = 50
ye attempts = 1

jab (guess == secret_number) {
  bol "Congratulations! Sahi guess kiya!"
  bol "Attempts:"
  bol attempts
} nahi_toh {
  jab (guess < secret_number) {
    bol "Too low! Bada number try kar"
  } nahi_toh {
    bol "Too high! Chota number try kar"
  }
}
```

