## 📚 Chapter 7: Tips & Tricks

### Tip 1: Variable Naming
```haryanvi
// Good names (achhe naam)
ye student_age = 20
ye total_marks = 450
ye is_passed = 1

// Bad names (kharab naam) - avoid
ye x = 20
ye abc = 450
ye t = 1
```

---

### Tip 2: Code Organization
```haryanvi
// Keep related code together
ye price = 100
ye quantity = 5
ye total = price * quantity

// Add blank lines for readability
ye discount = 10
ye final_price = total - discount
```

---

### Tip 3: Debugging with Print
```haryanvi
ye x = 10
bol x  // Check value

ye y = x * 2
bol y  // Verify calculation

ye z = y + 5
bol z  // Final check
```

---

### Tip 4: Start Simple, Build Complex
```haryanvi
// First, make it work simply
ye a = 10
ye b = 20
ye sum = a + b
bol sum

// Then add more features
ye c = 30
ye total = a + b + c
bol total
```

